The '''Stennes Shifters'''<ref name="AEYNTK">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that had an innate ability to use [[the Force]] to pass invisibly through crowds<ref name="USW">''[[Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition]]''</ref> and were typically hyper-wary of strangers.<ref name="AEYNTK" /> They could have [[Color|tan]] skin and brown [[hair]].<ref name="ANH" /> Known members of the species included [[Trinto Duaba]]<ref name="USW" /> and [[Braconnor Bakiska]].<ref name="AEYNTK" />

